      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if using `is_last_chunk: bool` would be a desirable simplification here (hiding/encapsulating the `IEND` detection within `fn process_bytes` and avoiding unnecessarily storing/exposing chunk type in/from `PngState`).",
